Changes made in Mikan, starting from Black's BlackBox commit 23ba344:
  - Renamed the app (applicationId uk.lqstudio.mikan) with a new name and icon.
  - New home screen: each clone runs as its own engine user, clones are grouped
    into "users" and folders, with launcher-style drag and drop.
  - Per-clone device identity: phone model presets, system property overrides in
    native code, and Settings provider values (android_id, device name).
  - Settings: theme, language, credits, update check.
The full list of changes is the git history of this repository.

